 Box drawing and block characters
   glyph-source           unset (default)
   glyph-source-box       unset (default)
   glyph-source-block     unset (default)

 Type the value and press Enter. Leave it empty to use the default.
 The console's font. The value is the name of a font set (a frit file, `NAME.vtfrit` in
 `/etc/vtium/fonts`). It can also be the name of a kbd console font, or with `font-engine = psf`
 the path of a PSF font; vtium then uses that one font. When unset, vtium uses the font from
 vconsole.conf, or else the font set `terminus`. If vtium cannot find the font, it uses its …

